  "stageId": "main_01-01",
  "title": "孤島",
  "storyCode": "1-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bfa7610fccfe8a89fcd7f437179422ed11a62898441e04a06dec874a5089245e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第七关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "是我的錯覺，還是天確實越來越暗了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "......我也希望是你的錯覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "不過我們本來時間就不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "天災雲的形狀比剛才黑壓壓的一片更加清晰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "嘖，裸眼看著它慢慢在頭上凝聚顯形，可不是什麼好兆頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "加上，下城區的每一條街道都可能埋伏著整合運動......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "不，這個說法太過保守了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "該說是，整合運動滿滿當當地擠在街上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "幾乎每條街上都有暴徒在搞破壞，搶劫，焚毀交通工具和店鋪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "這幫傢伙，是覺得天氣太好，所以出來野餐集會嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "現在跑出來野餐，一定會遭到天災的無情摧殘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "這說明大部分整合運動都是些被野蠻沖昏頭腦的傻瓜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......噗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "他們不是真的要......野餐啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "我，我只是發個牢騷，不是那個意思......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "這不是個形容嗎？難道說這是個包袱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "抱歉，總是在這種時候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "唔唔唔......沒，沒事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "反而是憋笑有點難受......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "唔，抱歉......明明是很緊要的時期，我卻......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "沒關係的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我們不是為了讓大家都哭喪著臉才建立起羅德島的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "羅德島，本來就希望各位，都能綻放笑容。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "阿，阿米婭......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "沒關係的，醫生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "那我們，就去為偵查工作貢獻一份力量吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "四點鐘方向的敵人，我會安靜地處理掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "只要他們體內的病變器官不是什麼警報器或爆炸物就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "另一側，游離於據點之外的大批整合運動，就交給我們吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "只要雜音夠大，就沒有人能分辨出裡面究竟包含了什麼聲音。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "那麼，各自行動起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
